  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian assistance for addressing food security and nutritional needs for Sahrawi Refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By bringing food aid closer to the SPHERE  standard for the most vulnerable Sahrawi refugees, CERF funding will enable the refugees to meet their pressing humanitarian needs and essential services. The project directly addresses food security and nutritional wellbeing which thereby strengthens the response capacity of UNHCR and its partners in the refugee camps. This project targets 90,000 refugees with food security activities.</narrative>
  </description>
